# NAME: Direct (直连 / PT、群晖、学术站点)
# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET —— 经典规则行，不带 policy 列
# SOURCE: https://github.com/TatisZ/My-rules/blob/main/Direct  (Egern YAML: domain_suffix_set)
